									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a></span><br /><span style="font-family: times;"><font size="3"><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b><br /></font></span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14679"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=827" title="View the profile of chakachakkaa">chakachakkaa</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 9<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://venus.walagata.com/w/elburro/GnollheadbeerA17.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Gnoll Head say hi<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=49931248" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=49931248&amp;img=5" alt="49931248" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=827"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14679#msg14679"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14679#msg14679">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> February 16, 2005, 04:43:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think its funny how people who don&#039;t play EQ anymore, and don&#039;t have any actual idea what the new expansion is really like from 1st person experience, jump right on the bash the new expansions bandwagon. The same people that have been daily spewing the same BS how SOE sucks. now because wah, wah, wah, EQ sucks so much now, blah, blah, blah. If you don&#039;t like EQ anymore, fine. Daily bashing of it seems to be what you still enjoy, and if thats true then fine also, I suppose its fairly inexpensive as far as hobbies go. I have seen same excuses over and over too...getting old. &quot;Well I liked it but it really went down hill after blah, blah, blah&quot;...&quot;That was the end for me when they nerfed blah, blah, blah&quot;.... will never really care about these opinions these people have, boo hoo.<br /><br />Personal opinion new expansion has alot of great improvements. Refreshing, back to basics storyline. Very graphically appealling zones. Exciting new content, and best of all tons of new tradeskills and tradeskill caps. I can&#039;t wait to start seeing what some of the new cultured armor and other tradeskill stuffs look like.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=650514" target="_blank"><img src="http://venus.walagata.com/w/elburro/SigningofDeclarationofGnollHead01e.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><span style="color: lime;">I hate to advocate drugs, alcohol, violence or insanity to anyone, but they&#039;ve always worked for me - HST(1937-2005) </span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14680"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 408<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14680#msg14680"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14680#msg14680">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> February 16, 2005, 05:09:38 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Plus, I imagine quite a large number of instanced zones. If all the portals in the Broodlands were any indication of this, I wouldn&#039;t be surprised if there were dozens.</div><br />But SOE already told us that instances are simply private instances of the main zones.&nbsp; Sometimes some routes will be blocked off in your instance to keep you heading toward your group task, but it&#039;s the same zone as the non instanced one.&nbsp; They&#039;re selling that as a good point.&nbsp; Go to familiar places!&nbsp; <br /><br />It&#039;s actually kind of amusing.&nbsp; Design fewer zones and try to get us to thank them for it.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm12.gif" alt="cwm12" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14689"></a>
