							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">2) Guild hall - This rocks, plain and simple. I don&#039;t understand why people expect this for free. It&#039;s a great place to consolidate. The porting stones on their own are a great implementation. The pool doubles health/mana regen so shouldn&#039;t be sniffed at.</div><br />Neato! Another free port! And I hear there is a corpse summon ability too. Both are REAL timesavers ... <br /><br />Now if they would only put in the Divine Rezzer and KEI Dispenser we would all be good. Oh yeah, and how about a clicky Gnomish Slowing Device vendor for those times when Uber_Slowing_Class_01 is not handy to come save your group ...
						</td>
