							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Does anyone else think Frodlin is a royal jackass on the EQ Live forums? Kinda off topic, and should really make a new thread, but his defense of how good something are is a bit innane.<br /><br />I mainly also said it here, because of his glowing review of DoN, and all the shit that is hitting the fan now because it wasn&#039;t all peaches and sunshine.<br /><br />(Note, not saying the expansion is total crap, but it&#039;s far from being as good as Frodlin likes to say it is)
