							<br />Well I like it - a lot..&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />And if you dont agree with me... <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/chair.gif" alt="chair" border="0" />
