	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14818"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1046" title="View the profile of Dose">Dose</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img44.exs.cx/img44/6244/ava4sj.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Pwner of Grass_Snake_01<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1046"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14818#msg14818"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14818#msg14818">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> February 21, 2005, 05:54:53 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Guild Hall - Needs a guild tribute master (and maybe reg. tribute master as well)<br /><br />Bazaar - needs to add the option of searching by level<br /><br />I don&#039;t like the new layout of the bazaar. It looks like the product of someone who got bored with simplicity.<br /><br />DoN = LoY + LDoN&#039;s love child on steroids<br /><br />Not the worst expansion ever, but yet another that adds content that should have been a patch, and not an expansion.<br /><br />PoP was the last expansion to provide enough content to consider a proper release, imho. It was the last to add at least 20 new zones, a la Luclin, Velious, and Kunark, the other 3 legit expansions. A lot of nice things have been added with LoY, LDoN, GoD, &amp; OoW, but not the volume of content that their predicessors had.<br /><br />I&#039;d give DoN a 6 on a 10 scale.<br /><br />Just my opinion.... 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=839285&amp;resize=true" target="_blank"><img src="http://img153.exs.cx/img153/8960/signi5pd.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
