								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14820#msg14820">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> February 21, 2005, 06:06:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg14799#msg14799">Quote from: Kinladar on February 21, 2005, 01:20:55 pm</a></div><div class="quote">I mainly also said it here, because of his glowing review of DoN, and all the shit that is hitting the fan now because it wasn&#039;t all peaches and sunshine.<br /><br />(Note, not saying the expansion is total crap, but it&#039;s far from being as good as Frodlin likes to say it is)<br /></div><br />Care to expand?&nbsp; Not a flame at all - I haven&#039;t seen anything other than a brief glimpse of some of the zones in beta.&nbsp; You mentioned the &quot;bazaar&quot; problem.&nbsp; What are the other &quot;shortcomings&quot; of this expansion?&nbsp; Or what is &quot;all the shit that is hitting the fan now&quot;?&nbsp; I don&#039;t read EQ Live forums, please give me a Reader&#039;s Digest summary please&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
